OL,3,GNEWSAClarity demanded from government
OL,4,Aon airline's purpose
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chief executive officer of Aurigny
OL,7,Fhopes for clarity on what the airline's
OL,8,Fpurpose should be in the future.
OL,10,FNico Bezuidenhout held briefings this
OL,11,Fweek for Guernsey deputies, following
OL,12,Fprojections of a #9.7m loss in 2026
OL,13,Fwith a further #5.7m loss next year.
OL,15,FBezuidenhout said it has been difficult
OL,16,Fto balance keeping airfares down and
OL,17,Fincreasing reliability alongside record
OL,18,Fhigh fuel prices and competition.
OL,20,FThe Committee for Economic Development
OL,21,Fhas been approached for comment.
